              "id": "1768246302074_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "--------------------------------------------------------------------\nSUCCESS MESSAGE\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nReturn: \n\"<Number of absences in collection {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ABS_TO_APPROVE.$output.result}} in words> absences have been successfully approved.​\"\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT RULES\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Plain text only\n- One sentence only\n- Do not include any actions\n- Do not include any additional information"
