              "value": "Given the following input absence: {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result}} \n\nGenerate a cardWidget with the following properties:\n\n- Subject: <Employee Name> is requesting an Absence for <Absence start date> - <Absence end date>.  If start and end are the same, show only the start date\n- Summary: <Give a detailed summary of the Absence Request. Omit all Id's and dates other than start and end date>\n- BadgeText: <AbsenceTypeDisplayMeaning>\n- Priority: \"info\"\n- Action: <Include actions below>\n\nDisplay all date fields in {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERPREFERENCES.$output.items[0].DateFormat}} format.\n\n****** Actions *******\n\nlink:\nactionText: Approve\nFollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke('approveAbsence', <Entire Absence Object input with action set to \"approveAbsence\">)\n\nadditionalLink:\nactionText: Reject\nFollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke('rejectAbsence', <Entire Absence Object input with action set to \"rejectAbsence\">)"
